From: Armada
Disable UBWC on A722 storage images.

With UBWC on storage images, A722 renders flashing black blocks
(Megabonk, native and under FEX). Turning off supports_uav_ubwc fixes it;
num_ccu, the A730 magic regs, cache flushes and sysmem rendering do not.
--- a/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
+++ b/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
@@ -997,7 +997,8 @@
         GPUId(chip_id=0xffff43020100, name="Adreno (TM) 722"),
     ], A6xxGPUInfo(
         CHIP.A7XX,
-        [a7xx_base, a7xx_gen1],
+        # UBWC on storage images corrupts rendering in blocks.
+        [a7xx_base, a7xx_gen1, GPUProps(supports_uav_ubwc = False)],
         num_ccu = 1,
         tile_align_w = 64,
         tile_align_h = 16,
